A '''building''' in the [[city]] of [[Palmo]] on the [[Colonies]] [[planet]] [[Ghorman]] existed by the time of the [[Imperial Era]]. In [[3 BBY]], a meeting would be convened at the Town Hall where many citizens of Ghorman complained to local elected officials about the [[Galactic Empire]]'s presence on the world. After the meeting, Imperial [[spy]] [[Syril Karn]] would be approached by the [[Ghorman Front]] about collaborating against the construction of the [[Palmo armory]], to which he agreed.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman" />

